# Boomy Appointments cron schedule
#
# Runs the reminder job every 30 minutes. The PHP script self-gates on the
# reminder_time setting, so extra invocations safely become no-ops.
#
# Deployment:
# 1. Copy this file into the container's configured cron directory.
# 2. Ensure the application directory is mounted at the path expected by
#    the cron command below.
# 3. Restart the application container and verify the cron entry is loaded.
# 4. Run the command manually once to confirm it returns valid JSON.
#
# Required settings in the settings table:
#   reminder_enabled      - must be '1' for reminders to run
#   reminder_days_before  - number of days ahead to check
#   reminder_time         - HH:MM time window for sending reminders
#
# Change the schedule below if the deployment environment requires it.
#
*/30 * * * * root /usr/local/bin/php /var/www/html/appointments/cron_reminders.php >> /var/log/cron_reminders.log 2>&1
